          "color": "dark_purple"
        },
        {
          "text": ", their forms shimmering softly against the backdrop of walls and obstructions. \n\nThis spectral view extends through solid barriers, revealing their presence and imbuing the spellcaster with an unparalleled awareness of the living world around them.\n\nThis spell can only be crafted by the "
        },
        {
          "text": "Undead.",
          "color": "dark_gray"
        }
